      "label": "Verse 2",
      "number": "2",
      "deva": "बीजस्यान्तरिवाङ्कुरो जगदिदं प्राङ्निर्विकल्पं पुनर्मायाकल्पितदेशकालकलनावैचित्र्यचित्रीकृतम् ।\nमायावीव विजृम्भयत्यपि महायोगीव यः स्वेच्छया तस्मै श्रीगुरुमूर्तये नम इदं श्रीदक्षिणामूर्तये ॥",
      "translation": "This world, like a sprout inside a seed, was undifferentiated at first. Later, māyā’s imagined distinctions of place, time, and reckoning make it various. Whoever unfolds it at will, like a magician or a great yogin—to that revered Dakṣiṇāmūrti, embodied as the teacher, this salutation is offered.",
